Stay on your god's good side, don't wear rings, and there's always food -
unless you need to ask your deity to bail you out of some other jam.
Just make sure not to pray until you are "weak" from hunger.

IN SUMMARY:
I think the WOW in the stronghold is a nice touch - and it takes care
of any missing items for a given strategy.  The game is very rich in
ideas and potential strategies, and the randomness of object/shop/altar
creation serves to challenge the player to hone his/her methods to
operate with the available tools.


